{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 5243979335815515979,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Testing the compiler",
      "source_hash": 16754516854087341233,
      "context_hash": 10275525963164394067,
      "translation": "컴파일러 테스트하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496973Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Rust project runs a wide variety of different tests, orchestrated by the build system (`./x test`).",
      "source_hash": 14691898073498036901,
      "context_hash": 10580570610320283604,
      "translation": "Rust 프로젝트는 빌드 시스템(`./x test`)을 통해 매우 다양한 종류의 테스트를 실행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This section gives a brief overview of the different testing tools.",
      "source_hash": 6635004155714919452,
      "context_hash": 4914279243375215564,
      "translation": "이 절에서는 다양한 테스트 도구에 대한 간략한 개요를 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Subsequent chapters dive into [running tests](running.md) and [adding new tests](adding.md).",
      "source_hash": 1215478594785208552,
      "context_hash": 14039043782557935395,
      "translation": "이어지는 장들은 [테스트 실행하기](running.md)와 [새 테스트 추가하기](adding.md)를 자세히 다룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Kinds of tests",
      "source_hash": 5521448166589317868,
      "context_hash": 397022573449693840,
      "translation": "테스트 종류",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There are several kinds of tests to exercise things in the Rust distribution.",
      "source_hash": 16847937972851113135,
      "context_hash": 7868593066717183474,
      "translation": "Rust 배포판의 기능들을 검증하기 위한 여러 종류의 테스트가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Almost all of them are driven by `./x test`, with some exceptions noted below.",
      "source_hash": 2956202442475386439,
      "context_hash": 16518147438063383555,
      "translation": "아래에서 언급하는 몇 가지 예외를 제외하면 거의 모두 `./x test`로 실행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Compiletest",
      "source_hash": 60042598858292196,
      "context_hash": 16508876450050535082,
      "translation": "Compiletest",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The main test harness for testing the compiler itself is a tool called [compiletest].",
      "source_hash": 12668117267397031700,
      "context_hash": 17294250361954921114,
      "translation": "컴파일러 자체를 테스트하기 위한 주된 테스트 하니스는 [compiletest]라는 도구입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "[compiletest] supports running different styles of tests, organized into *test suites*.",
      "source_hash": 2344287776804797924,
      "context_hash": 30411702014728707,
      "translation": "[compiletest]는 *테스트 스위트*로 조직화된 다양한 스타일의 테스트 실행을 지원합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "A *test mode* may provide common presets/behavior for a set of *test suites*. [compiletest]-supported tests are located in the [`tests`] directory.",
      "source_hash": 13341476508816574388,
      "context_hash": 16785380621471852656,
      "translation": "*테스트 모드*는 일련의 *테스트 스위트*에 공통되는 사전 설정/동작을 제공할 수 있습니다. [compiletest]가 지원하는 테스트들은 [`tests`] 디렉터리에 위치합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The [Compiletest chapter][compiletest] goes into detail on how to use this tool.",
      "source_hash": 17956358520012926089,
      "context_hash": 14316846433029727165,
      "translation": "[Compiletest 장][compiletest]에서는 이 도구를 사용하는 방법을 자세히 다룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Example: `./x test tests/ui`",
      "source_hash": 9184857822131527688,
      "context_hash": 4769852683543585753,
      "translation": "예시: `./x test tests/ui`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Package tests",
      "source_hash": 11978571826011439687,
      "context_hash": 13458624426658017574,
      "translation": "패키지 테스트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The standard library and many of the compiler packages include typical Rust `#[test]` unit tests, integration tests, and documentation tests.",
      "source_hash": 10734797174555027550,
      "context_hash": 15826619688045169166,
      "translation": "표준 라이브러리와 여러 컴파일러 패키지들은 일반적인 Rust `#[test]` 단위 테스트, 통합 테스트, 문서 테스트를 포함합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "You can pass a path to `./x test` for almost any package in the `library/` or `compiler/` directory, and `x` will essentially run `cargo test` on that package.",
      "source_hash": 13068147093603209403,
      "context_hash": 18388440370479038298,
      "translation": "`library/` 또는 `compiler/` 디렉터리 안의 거의 모든 패키지에 대해 `./x test`에 경로를 전달할 수 있으며, `x`는 해당 패키지에 대해 사실상 `cargo test`를 실행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Examples:",
      "source_hash": 5956079259256418663,
      "context_hash": 7609267844805085602,
      "translation": "예시:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Command",
      "source_hash": 2944556407430903182,
      "context_hash": 15004500980219282444,
      "translation": "명령어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Description",
      "source_hash": 1758583599421982602,
      "context_hash": 10574654074285154908,
      "translation": "설명",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "`./x test library/std`",
      "source_hash": 16376659434471567999,
      "context_hash": 11325620171291496317,
      "translation": "`./x test library/std`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Runs tests on `std` only",
      "source_hash": 1120864361908159711,
      "context_hash": 7539252669314156641,
      "translation": "`std`에 대해서만 테스트를 실행합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "`./x test library/core`",
      "source_hash": 3287318813597935579,
      "context_hash": 5411193667866796475,
      "translation": "`./x test library/core`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Runs tests on `core` only",
      "source_hash": 13202107734237075484,
      "context_hash": 11005209420508306400,
      "translation": "`core`에 대해서만 테스트를 실행합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "`./x test compiler/rustc_data_structures`",
      "source_hash": 9391410189605013873,
      "context_hash": 14152897986029922718,
      "translation": "`./x test compiler/rustc_data_structures`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "Runs tests on `rustc_data_structures`",
      "source_hash": 4089063955277472942,
      "context_hash": 16584240944069870543,
      "translation": "`rustc_data_structures`에 대해 테스트를 실행합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496976Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "The standard library relies very heavily on documentation tests to cover its functionality.",
      "source_hash": 6508656522640319597,
      "context_hash": 14612455515551358141,
      "translation": "표준 라이브러리는 자신의 기능을 다루기 위해 문서 테스트에 매우 크게 의존합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496976Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:18/seg:1",
      "source": "However, unit tests and integration tests can also be used as needed.",
      "source_hash": 3984049338196714252,
      "context_hash": 17931866849803034973,
      "translation": "하지만 필요한 경우 단위 테스트와 통합 테스트도 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496976Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:18/seg:2",
      "source": "Almost all of the compiler packages have doctests disabled.",
      "source_hash": 11281322192046326989,
      "context_hash": 13428315503000056159,
      "translation": "컴파일러 패키지들은 거의 대부분 문서 테스트가 비활성화되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496976Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "All standard library and compiler unit tests are placed in separate `tests` file (which is enforced in [tidy][tidy-unit-tests]).",
      "source_hash": 8213690121994709010,
      "context_hash": 18017606907464287934,
      "translation": "모든 표준 라이브러리 및 컴파일러 단위 테스트는 별도의 `tests` 파일에 배치됩니다([tidy][tidy-unit-tests]에서 이를 강제합니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496976Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:19/seg:1",
      "source": "This ensures that when the test file is changed, the crate does not need to be recompiled.",
      "source_hash": 17920217986120022946,
      "context_hash": 15830717286040121161,
      "translation": "이는 테스트 파일이 변경되었을 때 크레이트를 다시 컴파일할 필요가 없도록 보장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "crate": "크레이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496976Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:19/seg:2",
      "source": "For example:",
      "source_hash": 4114854479619665730,
      "context_hash": 8388777577430822001,
      "translation": "예를 들면:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496976Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "If it wasn't done this way, and you were working on something like `core`, that would require recompiling the entire standard library, and the entirety of `rustc`.",
      "source_hash": 2243952952145904992,
      "context_hash": 4998389786205910672,
      "translation": "만약 이런 방식으로 하지 않았다면, `core`와 같은 것을 작업할 때 표준 라이브러리 전체와 `rustc` 전체를 다시 컴파일해야 했을 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:28.496976Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:22/seg:0",
      "source": "`./x test` includes some CLI options for controlling the behavior with these package tests:",
      "source_hash": 1924304986904181036,
      "context_hash": 18174319307415296536,
      "translation": "`./x test`는 이러한 패키지 테스트의 동작을 제어하기 위한 몇 가지 CLI 옵션을 포함합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592817Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:23/seg:0",
      "source": "`--doc` — Only runs documentation tests in the package.",
      "source_hash": 1168835286962406606,
      "context_hash": 1360205902719712765,
      "translation": "`--doc` — 패키지 내 문서 테스트만 실행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592819Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:24/seg:0",
      "source": "`--all-targets` — Run all tests *except* documentation tests.",
      "source_hash": 4627524934214496193,
      "context_hash": 18284122368037259579,
      "translation": "`--all-targets` — 문서 테스트를 *제외한* 모든 테스트를 실행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592820Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:25/seg:0",
      "source": "`--tests` — Only runs unit and integration tests",
      "source_hash": 16170574620853368139,
      "context_hash": 10057859773841413059,
      "translation": "`--tests` — 단위 테스트와 통합 테스트만 실행합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592821Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:26/seg:0",
      "source": "Tidy",
      "source_hash": 10240999832536543080,
      "context_hash": 6950808367643996390,
      "translation": "Tidy",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592821Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:27/seg:0",
      "source": "Tidy is a custom tool used for validating source code style and formatting conventions, such as rejecting long lines.",
      "source_hash": 7314539149531469965,
      "context_hash": 14109946109022280861,
      "translation": "Tidy는 긴 줄을 거부하는 것과 같이 소스 코드 스타일과 포맷팅 규칙을 검증하는 데 사용되는 커스텀 도구입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592822Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:27/seg:1",
      "source": "There is more information in the [section on coding conventions](../conventions.md#formatting) or the [Tidy Readme].",
      "source_hash": 4159821882456618320,
      "context_hash": 2326318493769465020,
      "translation": "자세한 내용은 [코딩 규칙 섹션](../conventions.md#formatting) 또는 [Tidy Readme]를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592823Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:28/seg:0",
      "source": "Examples: `./x test tidy`",
      "source_hash": 1768616169276348387,
      "context_hash": 12366910473130578723,
      "translation": "예시: `./x test tidy`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592823Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:29/seg:0",
      "source": "Formatting",
      "source_hash": 5769237923756802682,
      "context_hash": 13412447088884573006,
      "translation": "Formatting",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592824Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:30/seg:0",
      "source": "Rustfmt is integrated with the build system to enforce uniform style across the compiler.",
      "source_hash": 11127821411619173645,
      "context_hash": 14384653706699679106,
      "translation": "Rustfmt는 컴파일러 전반에 걸쳐 일관된 스타일을 강제하기 위해 빌드 시스템에 통합되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592824Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:30/seg:1",
      "source": "The formatting check is automatically run by the Tidy tool mentioned above.",
      "source_hash": 15679598771137657481,
      "context_hash": 14673234048010743915,
      "translation": "포맷팅 검사는 위에서 언급한 Tidy 도구에 의해 자동으로 실행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592826Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:31/seg:0",
      "source": "Examples:",
      "source_hash": 5956079259256418663,
      "context_hash": 10709352732885838647,
      "translation": "예시:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592826Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:32/seg:0",
      "source": "Command",
      "source_hash": 2944556407430903182,
      "context_hash": 15004500980219282444,
      "translation": "Command",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592826Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:33/seg:0",
      "source": "Description",
      "source_hash": 1758583599421982602,
      "context_hash": 15431101075157934421,
      "translation": "Description",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592826Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:34/seg:0",
      "source": "`./x fmt --check`",
      "source_hash": 15545257872242314275,
      "context_hash": 959782776509415004,
      "translation": "`./x fmt --check`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592827Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:35/seg:0",
      "source": "Checks formatting and exits with an error if formatting is needed.",
      "source_hash": 18038679695733711052,
      "context_hash": 11794509315953011633,
      "translation": "포맷팅을 검사하고, 포맷팅이 필요한 경우 에러와 함께 종료합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592827Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:36/seg:0",
      "source": "`./x fmt`",
      "source_hash": 5833613487615316337,
      "context_hash": 15180988883795245886,
      "translation": "`./x fmt`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592827Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:37/seg:0",
      "source": "Runs rustfmt across the entire codebase.",
      "source_hash": 9063476934462833217,
      "context_hash": 10958235067883292027,
      "translation": "전체 코드베이스에 대해 rustfmt를 실행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592827Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:38/seg:0",
      "source": "`./x test tidy --bless`",
      "source_hash": 12630581376364837812,
      "context_hash": 11996986025861102805,
      "translation": "`./x test tidy --bless`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592828Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:39/seg:0",
      "source": "First runs rustfmt to format the codebase, then runs tidy checks.",
      "source_hash": 1905615659952571719,
      "context_hash": 3243833619809581089,
      "translation": "먼저 rustfmt를 실행하여 코드베이스를 포맷팅한 다음, tidy 검사를 실행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592829Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:40/seg:0",
      "source": "Book documentation tests",
      "source_hash": 3809841647243402151,
      "context_hash": 15182853597980754283,
      "translation": "Book documentation tests",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592829Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:41/seg:0",
      "source": "All of the books that are published have their own tests, primarily for validating that the Rust code examples pass.",
      "source_hash": 5666579039317934409,
      "context_hash": 11016946514016002951,
      "translation": "게시된 모든 책은 자체 테스트를 가지고 있으며, 이는 주로 Rust 코드 예제가 통과하는지 검증하기 위한 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592829Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:41/seg:1",
      "source": "Under the hood, these are essentially using `rustdoc --test` on the markdown files.",
      "source_hash": 8587382742668858893,
      "context_hash": 15033866635564112283,
      "translation": "내부적으로 이는 본질적으로 마크다운 파일에 대해 `rustdoc --test`를 사용하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592830Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:41/seg:2",
      "source": "The tests can be run by passing a path to a book to `./x test`.",
      "source_hash": 12775199290056589059,
      "context_hash": 14752260827630069585,
      "translation": "테스트는 `./x test`에 책의 경로를 전달하여 실행할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592830Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:42/seg:0",
      "source": "Example: `./x test src/doc/book`",
      "source_hash": 12959995707765550481,
      "context_hash": 14838626019091983921,
      "translation": "예시: `./x test src/doc/book`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:43/seg:0",
      "source": "Documentation link checker",
      "source_hash": 16306222094015685717,
      "context_hash": 4951806414188662925,
      "translation": "Documentation link checker",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:44/seg:0",
      "source": "Links across all documentation is validated with a link checker tool, and it can be invoked so:",
      "source_hash": 14364945119330424728,
      "context_hash": 12336733227716283858,
      "translation": "모든 문서 전반의 링크는 링크 검사 도구로 검증되며, 다음과 같이 실행할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:46/seg:0",
      "source": "This requires building all of the documentation, which might take a while.",
      "source_hash": 4805274565755375409,
      "context_hash": 14421621410707489989,
      "translation": "이는 모든 문서를 빌드해야 하므로 시간이 다소 걸릴 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592831Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:47/seg:0",
      "source": "`distcheck`",
      "source_hash": 673300622298296437,
      "context_hash": 15901851515945606270,
      "translation": "`distcheck`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:48/seg:0",
      "source": "`distcheck` verifies that the source distribution tarball created by the build system will unpack, build, and run all tests.",
      "source_hash": 16957225551836464523,
      "context_hash": 14038914627928685486,
      "translation": "`distcheck`는 빌드 시스템에서 생성된 소스 배포 tarball이 압축 해제, 빌드되고 모든 테스트를 실행할 수 있는지 검증합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:50/seg:0",
      "source": "Tool tests",
      "source_hash": 15097887378903988518,
      "context_hash": 11252502010067303641,
      "translation": "Tool tests",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:15:24.592833Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:51/seg:0",
      "source": "Packages that are included with Rust have all of their tests run as well.",
      "source_hash": 15066446566694252555,
      "context_hash": 16193412658204459882,
      "translation": "Rust에 포함된 패키지들도 모든 테스트가 실행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663568Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:51/seg:1",
      "source": "This includes things such as cargo, clippy, rustfmt, miri, bootstrap (testing the Rust build system itself), etc.",
      "source_hash": 5188232321949597902,
      "context_hash": 16457827030208101368,
      "translation": "여기에는 cargo, clippy, rustfmt, miri, bootstrap(Rust 빌드 시스템 자체를 테스트) 등이 포함됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663569Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:52/seg:0",
      "source": "Most of the tools are located in the [`src/tools`] directory.",
      "source_hash": 6713905398500406098,
      "context_hash": 11962667580528377810,
      "translation": "대부분의 도구는 [`src/tools`] 디렉터리에 위치해 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663569Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:52/seg:1",
      "source": "To run the tool's tests, just pass its path to `./x test`.",
      "source_hash": 5302293485946786555,
      "context_hash": 14131787947325627523,
      "translation": "도구의 테스트를 실행하려면, 해당 경로를 `./x test`에 전달하기만 하면 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663569Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:53/seg:0",
      "source": "Example: `./x test src/tools/cargo`",
      "source_hash": 7696211924092389704,
      "context_hash": 16666491950519322893,
      "translation": "예시: `./x test src/tools/cargo`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663569Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:54/seg:0",
      "source": "Usually these tools involve running `cargo test` within the tool's directory.",
      "source_hash": 323784340793812746,
      "context_hash": 673535734806109965,
      "translation": "보통 이러한 도구들은 도구 디렉터리 내에서 `cargo test`를 실행하는 방식으로 동작합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663569Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:55/seg:0",
      "source": "If you want to run only a specified set of tests, append `--test-args FILTER_NAME` to the command.",
      "source_hash": 2390928569277639099,
      "context_hash": 9271088817912662019,
      "translation": "지정된 테스트 집합만 실행하고 싶다면, 명령어에 `--test-args FILTER_NAME`을 추가하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663569Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:56/seg:0",
      "source": "Example: `./x test src/tools/miri --test-args padding`",
      "source_hash": 15755913294262924886,
      "context_hash": 10973364915209993393,
      "translation": "예시: `./x test src/tools/miri --test-args padding`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663569Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:57/seg:0",
      "source": "In CI, some tools are allowed to fail.",
      "source_hash": 17712564829371460851,
      "context_hash": 18086432297997550081,
      "translation": "CI에서는 일부 도구의 실패가 허용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663569Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:57/seg:1",
      "source": "Failures send notifications to the corresponding teams, and is tracked on the [toolstate website].",
      "source_hash": 15648272128713952149,
      "context_hash": 14590420764094300854,
      "translation": "실패는 해당 팀에 알림을 보내며, [toolstate website]에서 추적됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663570Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:57/seg:2",
      "source": "More information can be found in the [toolstate documentation].",
      "source_hash": 1456538145104424593,
      "context_hash": 1116358902376553496,
      "translation": "자세한 내용은 [toolstate documentation]에서 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663570Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:58/seg:0",
      "source": "Ecosystem testing",
      "source_hash": 17063819952683810810,
      "context_hash": 4534529892748618704,
      "translation": "생태계 테스트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663570Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:59/seg:0",
      "source": "Rust tests integration with real-world code to catch regressions and make informed decisions about the evolution of the language.",
      "source_hash": 17003521574355051549,
      "context_hash": 469661994707577003,
      "translation": "Rust는 실제 코드와의 통합을 테스트하여 회귀를 잡아내고 언어의 발전에 대해 정보에 입각한 결정을 내립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663570Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:59/seg:1",
      "source": "There are several kinds of ecosystem tests, including Crater.",
      "source_hash": 14011413632556107459,
      "context_hash": 11415497496253589714,
      "translation": "Crater를 포함하여 여러 종류의 생태계 테스트가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663571Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:59/seg:2",
      "source": "See the [Ecosystem testing chapter](ecosystem.md) for more details.",
      "source_hash": 8494761360690166527,
      "context_hash": 5098341582090108743,
      "translation": "자세한 내용은 [생태계 테스트 챕터](ecosystem.md)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663571Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:60/seg:0",
      "source": "Performance testing",
      "source_hash": 7210492460600831140,
      "context_hash": 14226976895578584236,
      "translation": "성능 테스트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663571Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:61/seg:0",
      "source": "A separate infrastructure is used for testing and tracking performance of the compiler.",
      "source_hash": 14025214984198558084,
      "context_hash": 8181325119716916569,
      "translation": "컴파일러의 성능을 테스트하고 추적하기 위해 별도의 인프라가 사용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663571Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:61/seg:1",
      "source": "See the [Performance testing chapter](perf.md) for more details.",
      "source_hash": 1902689934661432647,
      "context_hash": 13306058968826687048,
      "translation": "자세한 내용은 [성능 테스트 챕터](perf.md)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663571Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:62/seg:0",
      "source": "Codegen backend testing",
      "source_hash": 10104862066843688296,
      "context_hash": 16983150350960798026,
      "translation": "코드 생성 백엔드 테스트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "codegen": "코드 생성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663571Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:63/seg:0",
      "source": "See [Codegen backend testing](./codegen-backend-tests/intro.md).",
      "source_hash": 13058650918149380002,
      "context_hash": 2014713171280186346,
      "translation": "[코드 생성 백엔드 테스트](./codegen-backend-tests/intro.md)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "codegen": "코드 생성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:31.663572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Miscellaneous information",
      "source_hash": 1510817199822468810,
      "context_hash": 11503750089185885728,
      "translation": "기타 정보",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
